# CODEOWNERS — every change must be reviewed & approved by the repository owner.
#
# Combined with a Branch Protection Rule that requires review from Code Owners,
# this makes it impossible for anyone (including a stolen collaborator account
# or a remote attacker) to merge changes into the protected branches without
# the owner's explicit approval.
#
# Replace @perofesor below if the GitHub owner handle differs.

*           @perofesor

# Extra guard on the highest-risk areas.
/src/                 @perofesor
/public/              @perofesor
/.github/             @perofesor
/src/utils/sanitize.js @perofesor
/src/server.js        @perofesor
